9,"text":"As we have said before, so I now say again: if any man preaches to you any “good news” other than that which you received, let him be cursed."},{"verse":10,"text":"For am I now seeking the favor of men, or of God? Or am I striving to please men? For if I were still pleasing men, I wouldn’t be a servant of Christ."},{"verse":11,"text":"But I make known to you, brothers, concerning the Good News which was preached by me, that it is not according to man."},{"verse":12,"text":"For I didn’t receive it from man, nor was I taught it, but it came to me through revelation of Jesus Christ."},{"verse":13,"text":"For you have heard of my way of living in time past in the Jews’ religion, how that beyond measure I persecuted the assembly of God and ravaged it."},{"verse":14,"text":"I advanced in the Jews’ religion beyond many of my own age among my countrymen, being more exceedingly zealous for the traditions of my fathers."},{"verse":15,"text":"But when it was the good pleasure of God, who separated me from my mother’s womb and called me through his grace,"},{"verse":16,"text":"to reveal his Son in me, that I might preach him among the Gentiles, I didn’t immediately confer with flesh and blood,"},{"verse":17,"text":"nor did I go up to Jerusalem to those who were apostles before me, but I went away into Arabia. Then I returned to Damascus."},{"verse":18,"text":"Then after three years I went up to Jerusalem to visit Peter, and stayed with him fifteen days."},{"verse":19,"text":"But of the other apostles I saw no one except James, the Lord’s brother."},{"verse":20,"text":"Now about the things which I write to you, behold, before God, I’m not lying."},{"verse":21,"text":"Then I came to the regions of Syria and Cilicia."},{"verse":22,"text":"I was still unknown by face to the assemblies of Judea which were in Christ,"},{"verse":23,"text":"but they only heard, “He who once persecuted us now preaches the faith that he once tried to destroy.”"},{"verse":24,"text":"So they glorified God in me."}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]}]